@startuml
title Event Management ( Scenario 2: Point-to-Point )

participant "TMFCxxx (Producer)" as Producer
participant "TMFCxxx (Consumer)" as Consumer

group Consumer Registers listener

    Consumer -> Producer : 1 **TMFxxx API:**\nPost /Hub (Callback="URL Given By The Consumer", query=eventType"EventName", filter="Optinnal filter")
    Producer --> Consumer : 2 200 OK (HubId="",status="subscribed")

end

group Producer Publish Event to listener

    Producer -> Consumer : 3 **TMFxxx API:**\nPost /Listener/eventName\n(eventId="EventId", eventType="EventType", data="EventData")
    Consumer --> Producer : 4 200 OK

end

@enduml
